# Gideon, Battle-Forged: "+1: Until your next turn, target creature gains indestructible. Untap that creature" (CR 611.2a,
# 701.26b). After the attack that transforms Kytheon on turn 3, the +1 - which can't target a Plains - untaps an
# attacking Ornithopter with indestructible: Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 4 marks 3 damage on it and it survives. On turn
# 5, Bot1's next turn, the indestructible is gone, and the +1 targets Bot2's Dwarven Mauler: an opponent's creature is a
# target too. Gideon has 3 + 1 + 1 loyalty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Kytheon, Hero of Akros
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Dwarven Mauler
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kytheon, Hero of Akros.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Dwarven Mauler.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Kytheon, Hero of Akros > Bot2; Ornithopter#1 > Bot2; Ornithopter#2 > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon, Battle-Forged.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Plains; Ability: +1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon, Battle-Forged.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1; Ability: +1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Keywords = Flying; Indestructible
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Damage = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon, Battle-Forged.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Dwarven Mauler; Ability: +1)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon, Battle-Forged.Counters.Loyalty = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Dwarven Mauler.Keywords = Indestructible
